    {
      "id": "claim_e1fe622d2b674d868a026d288ffe3711",
      "statement": "The taxonomic perimeter defined in config/taxa_catalog.yaml serves as the single source of truth for species metadata and alias resolution, with pipeline components deriving dense class index mappings dynamically via get_catalog_inat_taxon_map() to eliminate hardcoded label drifts.",
