      "id": "claim_c60dd8106bf04c87ad3282de596bb31a",
      "statement": "The classification head training pipeline loads pre-extracted representation tensors to train a lightweight linear head in memory, employing ClassBalancedLoss to mitigate biodiversity class imbalance, Optuna for automated hyperparameter tuning, and MLflow for experiment tracking and conditional checkpoint promotion.",
