      "id": "claim_ff27c79971a040fb849ac000910bab86",
      "statement": "The TaxonVision microservice unifies REST endpoints, explainability routes, Prometheus metrics, and HTMX triage dashboards within a single FastAPI application, serving inference via an optimized ONNX Runtime engine with fallback to PyTorch TaxonClassifier when configured or in fallback mode.",
