    {
      "id": "claim_f6ea50c24c5548288be65373876c8163",
      "statement": "The serving workload is deployed to Kubernetes in the taxon-vision namespace across two replicas with rolling updates, running under an unprivileged non-root user (UID/GID 10001), with read-only hostPath mounts for checkpoints and liveness/readiness health probes.",
